#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "将联系人、公司和你自己的资料导出为 .vcf 名片，也可以读入名片文件。关闭后，不再提供下载和导入，其地址也会像不存在一样响应。"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "DOCX"
msgstr "DOCX"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Extend file formats"
msgstr "扩展文件格式"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "iCalendar"
msgstr "iCalendar"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "ODT"
msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "OpenDocument 文本：简历或信函可下载为 .odt 文件，你上传的 .odt 文件的文本会被保存，以便搜索时能找到。关闭后，不再提供下载，也不会读取上传文件的文本。"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "将公司的地点导出为 GeoJSON 文件，也可以读入点，在你勾选后用它们手动定位公司的地址。需要“地图”。关闭后，两者都不再提供，其地址也会像不存在一样响应。"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "除自身格式外，Postulo 可以读写的文件格式：PDF、Word、OpenDocument、iCalendar、vCard 和 Europass。这是同时控制所有格式的开关；此开关开启时，每一项仍可单独关闭，但 PDF 不能关闭。关闭后，不再提供这些格式，也不会删除任何内容：你已有的文件以及生成它们的数据都会保留。"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "生成简历和信函所用的格式：带标签结构，屏幕阅读器可以读取。始终开启；Postulo 没有其他格式能作为简历使用。"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Word 文档：简历或信函可下载为 .docx 文件，你上传的 .docx 文件的文本会被保存，以便搜索时能找到。关闭后，不再提供下载，也不会读取上传文件的文本。"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "将你的日历导出为 .ics 文件和订阅源，也可以读入日历文件。关闭后，不再提供下载、导入和订阅源，其地址也会像不存在一样响应；重新开启后，它们会在同一地址上再次响应。"
